Package: myMicrobiomeHelpers
Type: Package
Title: Helper Functions for Microbiome Analysis and Bootstrapping Networks
Version: 0.1.0
Author: Tiago Feitosa Mota <tiagofmotavet@gmail.com>
Maintainer: Tiago Feitosa Mota <tiagofmotavet@gmail.com>
Description: A minimalist package containing helper functions to facilitate the 
    microbiome analysis of 16S rRNA sequencing data and to bootstrap microbial 
    network evaluations using phyloseq and ggClusterNet.
